  "details": "<p>The Barrington Atlas Directory notes: Proserpina to Emerita Augusta</p>",
  "review_state": "published",
  "type": "FeatureCollection",
  "description": "The so-called \"Acueducto de los Milagros\" (miraculous aqueduct) that supplied Augusta Emerita from the Lago de Proserpina north of the city. A small portion of the impressive aqueduct bridge still stands in M\u00e9rida.",
